corsair-lncore-dkms (0.1.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Multi-package Debian structure: separate DKMS and CLI packages
  * DKMS package (all): kernel module source, udev rules
  * CLI package (any): command-line tool binary
  * Updated CI/CD to build and distribute both packages
  * Improved packaging structure for better Debian compliance

  -- Ross Golder <ross@golder.org>  Wed, 15 Jan 2025 12:00:00 +0000

corsair-lncore-dkms (0.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Security improvements: input validation, bounds checking, mutex protection
  * Enhanced documentation with API details, Secure Boot guide, troubleshooting
  * CI/CD updates: modern GitHub Actions, CodeQL security scanning
  * Improved udev rules with proper group permissions
  * Added cln-cli command-line tool for easy LED control
  * Code hardening and maintainer updates

  -- Ross Golder <ross@golder.org>  Wed, 15 Jan 2025 11:00:00 +0000

corsair-lncore-dkms (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of Corsair Lighting Node Core DKMS driver
  * Supports direct LED color control, effects, brightness, firmware query
  * Includes udev rules for non-root access

  -- Ross Golder <ross@golder.org>  Wed, 15 Jan 2025 10:00:00 +0000
